      "publication": "2014-01-25",
      "original_sha256": "3ea048f257f95ca9dac90b97da8593fb8dd78640d1fc70cdb47bbcf47f3bb69c",
      "visible": "2005年10月31日市政府公布的墙牌。南昌路57号、1931年建、砖混结构、西班牙式、红瓦屋面、曲线形山花及红砖叠涩出挑装饰带。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "source_url": "https://s12.sinaimg.cn/mw690/001HIrzOgy6FJFOah5x0b&690",
      "webpage": "https://blog.sina.com.cn/s/blog_5d1bdf480101gxl2.html",
      "author": "高参88",
      "publication": "2014-01-25",
      "original_sha256": "94fbef616658e89bf4d5c60967954ac9c801699e7c23c88f61caa9099b758f89",
      "visible": "门前原图。上海科技发展展示馆题额、双开铁门、两有槽圆柱、筒瓦顶及旁窗。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "source_url": "https://s2.sinaimg.cn/mw690/001HIrzOgy6FJzuSitjf1&690",
      "webpage": "https://blog.sina.com.cn/s/blog_5d1bdf480101gxl2.html",
      "author": "高参88",
      "publication": "2014-01-25",
      "original_sha256": "ececcd70b83c02223b98f6bdfbb3f4035a26d2e067df2df135c98c13fd5b4d8e",
      "visible": "同文另一座小棚：可见方柱，未作为本门廊依据。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "source_url": "https://s16.sinaimg.cn/mw690/001HIrzOgy6FJzuXmQT8f&690",
      "webpage": "https://blog.sina.com.cn/s/blog_5d1bdf480101gxl2.html",
      "author": "高参88",
      "publication": "2014-01-25",
      "original_sha256": "044e78bd054e55a35520a10ab442c4ae1d0c3ccc1a298c529c593bf20b9568c1",
      "visible": "门棚斜照。圆柱与退入铁门、上层前后折角、长短穿花栏板和白色券窗框。"
    }
